~ start

Entity: [shake rate=18 level=6]...O...llie...[/shake]

Ollie: Who's there?

Entity: [shake rate=20 level=8]You can hear me.[/shake] [wait=0.8]That is... [shake rate=30 level=12]unfortunate.[/shake]

Ollie: Show yourself!

Entity: [shake rate=15 level=5]I have been here since before the rain.[/shake]
Entity: [shake rate=15 level=5]I am in the walls. In the pipes. In the water.[/shake]

Ollie: What do you want?

Entity: [shake rate=22 level=7]To warn you.[/shake]
Entity: [shake rate=25 level=10]The water is not done rising.[/shake]
Entity: [speed=0.4]It never is.[/speed]

Ollie: The rescuers will come. They always come.

Entity: [shake rate=18 level=6]They will come.[/shake] [wait=1.0][shake rate=35 level=14]Late.[/shake]
Entity: [shake rate=18 level=6]Everyone who waited... [/shake][wait=0.6][shake rate=40 level=16]was late.[/shake]

Ollie: Stop it. You're not real.

Entity: [shake rate=12 level=4]Am I not?[/shake]
Entity: [shake rate=12 level=4]Then who is whispering in your ear?[/shake]

# Optional: raises insanity when the player hears this
# do GameState.add_insanity(5, "entity warning")

Entity: [shake rate=28 level=10]Find a light.[/shake]
Entity: [shake rate=28 level=10]Find a sound.[/shake]
Entity: [shake rate=22 level=8]Something that cuts through the dark.[/shake]
Entity: [shake rate=45 level=18]Or you will be forgotten.[/shake]

Ollie: ...What does that mean?

Entity: [speed=0.3][shake rate=10 level=3]Listen.[/shake][/speed]

Ollie: ...I can hear it. The water. It's getting louder.

=> END